### 682
a) 6/7=48/56 < 49/56=7/8, so the first power is smaller.
b) sqrt(3)<sqrt(7), so the first power is smaller.
c) -sqrt(5)<-sqrt(3), so the first power is smaller.
Reason in all three cases: 2^t is strictly increasing.

### 683
a) 2^-100 < 1.
b) 2^0.0001 > 1.
